OL,3,ANanotyrannus skeleton goes to auction
OL,4,Ain New York with #4.5m price tag
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mounted skeleton of a
OL,7,Fnewly-identified dinosaur once mistaken
OL,8,Ffor a young Tyrannosaurus rex is up for
OL,9,Fauction - with a price-tag of at least
OL,10,F$6m (#4.5m).
OL,12,FNicknamed "Jodi", the roughly
OL,13,F10-foot-tall (3m) skeleton will be
OL,14,Fauctioned by Sotheby's in New York. The
OL,15,Fsale comes a year after researchers
OL,16,Fconfirmed that the skeleton belongs to
OL,17,Fa distinct genus.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
