OL,3,ANanotyrannus skeleton goes to auction
OL,4,Ain New York with #4.5m price tag
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Late Cretaceous carnivore is
OL,7,Fexpected to fetch up to $9m when it
OL,8,Fgoes under the hammer on Tuesday. The
OL,9,Fauction comes after Sotheby's sold a
OL,10,FTyrannosaurus rex, dubbed "Gus", for a
OL,11,Frecord $50.1m (#37.4m) in July.
OL,13,FThe sale comes as some in the
OL,14,Fscientific community debate whether
OL,15,Fdinosaur remains should be sold
OL,16,Fprivately.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
